ref10 (Daniel J. Bernstein, Niels Duif, Tanja Lange, Peter Schwabe,
Bo-Yin Yang et al. -- the SUPERCOP / NaCl "ref10" ed25519 implementation)

  Public domain.

  sello's field arithmetic (src/sello/field.nim), Edwards curve group
  operations and scalar multiplication (src/sello/scalar.nim), and the
  RFC 8032 encode/decode and scalar-reduction layer (src/sello/ed25519.nim,
  src/sello/scalar.nim) are direct ports of ref10's algorithms and, in
  several routines, its exact arithmetic structure. Individual functions
  carry a "ported from ref10 (public domain)" attribution in their doc
  comments at the point of use.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

orlp/ed25519 (Orson Peters)
https://github.com/orlp/ed25519

  Public domain (CC0 / Unlicense dual release, per the upstream README).

  Consulted alongside ref10 as a second reference for the field and
  curve arithmetic ports named above; sello exists specifically to
  provide a pure-Nim alternative to wrapping this project's C.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

TweetNaCl (Daniel J. Bernstein, Bernard van Gastel, Wesley Janssen,
Tanja Lange, Peter Schwabe, Sjaak Smetsers)
https://tweetnacl.cr.yp.to/

  Public domain.

  Consulted for the Edwards point addition/subtraction formulas
  (Hisil-Wong-Carter-Dawson, "Twisted Edwards Curves Revisited," 2008)
  as implemented in src/sello/scalar.nim, alongside ref10.

